OL,3,GNEWSAHistorian excited to return to
OL,4,A'natural habitat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historian and author who made the
OL,7,FBBC's Horrible Histories for 11 years
OL,8,Fhas said an upcoming appearance at a
OL,9,Flibrary will be like returning to his
OL,10,F"natural habitat".
OL,12,FGreg Jenner, who also hosts the You're
OL,13,FDead To Me podcast, will be chatting to
OL,14,Fcontent creator Katie Kennedy during
OL,15,Fthe free event in Crawley organised by
OL,16,FWest Sussex libraries.
OL,18,FThe event is part of the Go All In
OL,19,Ffestival which has been created for
OL,20,Fyoung people with #30,000 of National
OL,21,FLottery money.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
